ne business workflows.","conclusion":"Saved hundreds of operational hours per month by bridging CRM, billing, messaging, and database updates seamlessly.","thumbnail":{"src":"/images/call-to-action/n8n Automation Workflow .png","alt":"Workflow Hub project thumbnail"},"heroImage":{"src":"/images/call-to-action/n8n Automation Workflow .png","alt":"Workflow Hub project hero preview"},"coverImage":{"src":"/images/call-to-action/n8n Automation Workflow .png","alt":"Workflow Hub project showcase"},"images":[{"src":"/images/call-to-action/n8n Automation Workflow .png","alt":"Workflow Hub project showcase image 1"},{"src":"/images/n8n/automation.png","alt":"Workflow Hub project showcase image 2"},{"src":"/images/n8n/automation .png","alt":"Workflow Hub project showcase image 3"}],"services":["n8n Architecture","API & Webhook Integrations","Data Transformation","Workflow Optimization"],"serviceSlugs":["n8n-automation"],"client":"Internal & Client Systems","website":"","tags":["n8n","Automation","Webhooks","REST APIs","Pipelines"],"link":"","quote":"Turned complex multi-tool operational headaches into reliable, zero-touch background automation.","quoteAuthor":"Automation Engineering","quoteRole":"Integration Systems"},"nextProject":{"slug":"quickdrop","title":"QuickDrop","category":"Peer-to-Peer Mobile Application","year":"2025","tagline":"A Flutter marketplace connecting senders with travelers for package delivery.","description":"A peer-to-peer package delivery mobile application built with Flutter and Firebase, connecting senders with travelers through secure payments, messaging, and real-time delivery updates.","overview":"QuickDrop is a cross-platform mobile application that connects people who need to ship packages with travelers moving along the same route. Senders can create shipment listings, while couriers can publish trips, manage deliveries, and earn money along their routes. The platform includes Google authentication, Firebase-backed user and shipment management